            "notes": "## Items\n\n[Weapon Jammer](item_72386db6-753e-413d-aa2a-f1389842f47f) is insane for Tracer, providing roughly 20% more damage at the cost of burning more ammo. [Underworld Quickloader](item_dc8e93b1-a561-4007-bfdc-42839f612d01) is very similar and a bit more expensive but the effect is quite strong.\n\nIf you have enough cash to buy [Eye of the Spider](item_bbaf01d7-340d-4199-b738-86a98d68fe9b) without selling other items, then go for this.\n\nThe other new item is [Aftermarket Firing Pin](item_2485b212-b286-42d0-a2bd-20eb4396b054). Very straightforward for more attack speed. You could also run [Icy Coolant](item_8b1c21e9-33e8-49a6-8277-a3a06d55a65f) if you have more money or [Emergency Chip](item_c73e060f-94df-4e6b-bb6d-fe2f65e31dd1) if you want a bit more HP.\n\nThe more defensive option, which is strong in general against heroes who shoot many low damage pellets/projectiles and also beams is [Vital-E-Tee](item_b92e6f1d-3aac-4eec-b027-00c8e1529016) (except [Winton](item_1c8c3f53-4ed4-417f-a3b2-e7c52bda907am), he ignores armor). It's 30% flat damage reduction versus [Moira](hero_7fb6ff1e-a193-40c0-bd0a-25c1928fbaed) secondary fire and [Zarya](hero_be6cc516-0b7a-4515-8472-f489f08993b0) primary fire, around 25% versus [Genji](hero_31fd201d-2f46-41e4-b125-9fa9e55fed46), and 50% versus [Tracer](hero_bcc3aeb4-369e-4abb-b686-3234c169d37a), [Soldier: 76](hero_e1ac7ef5-4648-4998-b8b0-9e3da3e60546) and [Reaper](hero_0449752f-1c58-487b-b9a0-ca727d784457).",
